  "description": "This astrodynamics framework provides tools to manipulate orbital parameters, run spacecraft propagation, evaluate impulsive maneuvers, generate fuel balance, compute spacecraft attitudes (prograde, nadir, normal, TRIAD with orbital/celestial targets), propagate with the adaptive Prince-Dormand RK7(8) integrator and a fluent propagator builder, model albedo and thermal radiation pressure, work in the CIO-based GCRF/CIRS/TIRS frames, run batch and Monte Carlo dispersion analyses, assess conjunctions and collision probability, read and write CCSDS OMM/OPM/CDM messages, ...",
